{
  "_comment": "Star-constellation drawings for the tales of trilogy's aft.csv, for rendering as constellations (decoder: src/lib/constellations.js). A tale's drawing is 'tales'[tale id] if it has one, else 'types'[its ATU type]. A drawing is a space-separated list of parts on a 36x36 grid (y down, as in SVG), all numbers base-36 digits ('0'-'9', 'a'-'z' = 0-35) and a point two of them. A run of points is joined by lines in order, a single point being a lone star; 'Q' and a control point before a point curve the line to it (as in SVG), and a trailing 'Z' closes the run. 'O' with a center, a radius and an optional count of stars (4 if left out) is a circle with that many stars spaced evenly around it from the top. '@name' draws one of the 'icons' whole, '@name:XYS' places it at X,Y scaled by S/35, and a trailing '-' mirrors it left to right. Every distinct point is one star; control points and circles are not. Side views of animals face right. Stars carry no styling: size, brightness and color are up to the renderer.",
